#edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0d50181b-9c79-5e2d-8fe3-df70311bbab2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186118357 #edb/ref 1080 "8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186118357 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186118357 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "69993763-cf26-53da-b98c-762146e4ea05" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119612 #edb/ref 1069 "e-4782" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119612 #edb/ref 1071 "Let ![](images/3b/3b40aa273b0ea1138535c7bfc77c2c80ee16a14570a8cbf0e9306ea66ad6c5d0.svg) Find $\\dfrac{1}{2} \\mathbf{a}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119612 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "13fa2a8c-de7c-59ee-a838-2997494edc56" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119612 #edb/ref 1074 "Multiplying each component of $\\mathbf{a}$ by $\\dfrac{1}{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}a & =\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-4) \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 6 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 3 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186119613 #edb/ref 1069 "e-4783" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119613 #edb/ref 1071 "Let ![](images/f3/f3118303ab755b84d1a8065e3fef0ff13c2ff44e3601c3aae0207022b64c09fa.svg) and ![](images/dd/dd226e3cb1952497d8f546e4ee73d4860f23ccda89662bc2a4012f583aa6dc24.svg) Find $\\dfrac{1}{3}\\mathbf{a}+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\mathbf{b}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119613 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "1e82713d-4063-5bcd-bc2e-1d35c831ab34" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119613 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we multiply each component of $\\mathbf{a}$ by $\\dfrac{1}{3}$ and each component of $\\mathbf{b}$ by $\\dfrac{1}{2}.$ Then, we add the vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}a+\\frac{1}{2}b & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 12 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-2 \\\\ 2-3 \\\\ 4+1 \\\\ -3-4 \\\\ 1+5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186119614 #edb/ref 1069 "e-4784" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119614 #edb/ref 1071 "If ![](images/86/8639fb58fd989253bb0095f58c39189ce653683c908d22a787c7454447ae706c.svg) and ![](images/24/24145ff5ab9076ec70b5e8f57304bd93e507154b5ad7cb61b5a580445fdad3dd.svg) then what is $\\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{v}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119614 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ba38ff28-b4f3-59b8-b18a-a278db26294d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119614 #edb/ref 1074 "To compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & ={u}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{1}+{u}_{2}\\cdot {v}_{2}+{u}_{3}\\cdot {v}_{3}+{u}_{4}\\cdot {v}_{4} \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot (-2)+4\\cdot 3+3\\cdot (-4)+(-5)\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =2+12-12-30 \\\\  & =-28\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119615 #edb/ref 1069 "e-4785" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119615 #edb/ref 1071 "Let be ![](images/87/870f39e6853ca1dc2013d9b82beb35e1533a3d4b5f2318cf607f1f19efdeb0d7.svg) and ![](images/9f/9f51885fedc5cf606a4e2c48663c5e85df144fe004adf7795677a3a4dc37218a.svg) If $\\mathbf{a}\\cdot \\mathbf{b}=0,$ find the value of $x.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119615 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "3ec5f9d5-327b-59e5-8df7-fb37d4054021" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186119615 #edb/ref 1074 "Starting from the equation $\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}=0,$ we compute the dot product in terms of $x$ and then solve for $x$ in the resulting equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ 10\\cdot x+x\\cdot x+0\\cdot 8+5\\cdot 5 & =0 \\\\ 10x+{x}^{2}+25 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+10x+25 & =0 \\\\ (x+5)^{2} & =0 \\\\ x & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude